{"unit_id":"CalamitySpiritKite__dsh-bili-merlin#card-zh","repo":"CalamitySpiritKite/dsh-bili-merlin","commit":"9dfad84edd50e48ff44ec49b8f87a34a0da65f7c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"养鱼·梅林是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 B 站内容浏览与互动插件。它在 DSH 设置页提供作息、偏好、互动开关、通知和工具链配置，并由后台调度器按设定窗口唤醒会话。工具链可按偏好从搜索、热门、排行和关注动态中挑选未看视频，汇总字幕、弹幕热区、热评与视频画面信息，再写入日记；用户也可查看观看记录、运行环境自检、管理私信白名单和待审回复。另提供点赞、投币、收藏、关注等命令。使用需要 B 站登录 Cookie（SESSDATA、bili_jct），运行环境要求 Node.js 20 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:612-630","lib/scheduler.js:120-140","tools/commands/feed.mjs:1-16","tools/commands/debrief.mjs:1-4","lib/index.js:282-320"]}
{"unit_id":"CalamitySpiritKite__dsh-bili-merlin#card-en","repo":"CalamitySpiritKite/dsh-bili-merlin","commit":"9dfad84edd50e48ff44ec49b8f87a34a0da65f7c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Yangyu Merlin is a DSH web plugin for scheduled Bilibili browsing. It selects unseen videos by preference, gathers subtitles and danmaku for diary review, and provides watch history, environment checks, DM allowlists, and pending replies. Bilibili login cookies and Node.js 20+ are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:612-630","lib/scheduler.js:120-140","tools/commands/feed.mjs:1-16","tools/commands/debrief.mjs:1-4","lib/index.js:282-320"]}
