{"unit_id":"CalamitySpiritKite__dsh-bili-merlin#feature-1","repo":"CalamitySpiritKite/dsh-bili-merlin","commit":"9dfad84edd50e48ff44ec49b8f87a34a0da65f7c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"养鱼·梅林 的功能「偏好选题」：从偏好关键词及热门、排行和关注动态等来源收集 B 站视频，结合已看记录排除重复项并输出候选。可通过 feed 工具链触发，输入来自配置偏好和 B 站账号信息，产出供后续观看的候选视频。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools/commands/feed.mjs:1-16","tools/commands/feed.mjs:90-112"]}
{"unit_id":"CalamitySpiritKite__dsh-bili-merlin#feature-2","repo":"CalamitySpiritKite/dsh-bili-merlin","commit":"9dfad84edd50e48ff44ec49b8f87a34a0da65f7c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"养鱼·梅林 的功能「视频解读」：针对给定 BV 号整理视频字幕和弹幕时间热点等内容，并支持抽帧拼图辅助理解画面。通过 debrief 命令触发，输入视频编号，输出可供 DSH 会话阅读的分析材料。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools/commands/debrief.mjs:1-4","tools/commands/debrief.mjs:78-115"]}
